#: includes/Modules/CustomCss/CustomCssModule.php:42
msgid ""
"Add your custom CSS here to style plugin elements without overriding your "
"global site CSS. <br><br><b>Class Glossary:</b><br>\n"
"                <code>a.tweak-tools-sdf30s-read-more</code> : The \"Read "
"More\" button (Feat 2).<br>\n"
"                <code>.button.alt.tweak-tools-sdf30-validatenow</code> : The "
"\"Buy now\" button (Direct Checkout).<br>\n"
"                <code>.stock.wt-smart-stock-active</code> : The dynamic "
"urgency message.<br>\n"
"                <code>.wt-account-toggle-btn</code> : Toggle buttons (My "
"Account).<br>\n"
"                <code>.wt-retractable-section</code> : Container for hidden "
"Email/Password fields.<br>\n"
"                <code>#billing_birth_date_field</code> : Date of birth field."
"<br>\n"
"                <code>.wt-toggle-stock</code> : Stock toggle link (Admin "
"Product List).<br>\n"
"                <code>.wt-promo-badge</code> : Discount percentage badge.<br>"
"\n"
"                <code>.wt-promo-urgency-msg</code> : Promotion end message."
msgstr ""
"Ajoutez votre CSS personnalisé ici pour styliser les éléments du plugin sans "
"écraser le CSS global de votre site. <br><br><b>Glossaire des classes :</b>"
"<br>\n"
"                <code>a.tweak-tools-sdf30s-read-more</code> : Le bouton \"En "
"savoir plus\" (Fct 2).<br>\n"
"                <code>.button.alt.tweak-tools-sdf30-validatenow</code> : Le "
"bouton \"Acheter maintenant\" (Achat direct).<br>\n"
"                <code>.stock.wt-smart-stock-active</code> : Le message "
"d'urgence dynamique.<br>\n"
"                <code>.wt-account-toggle-btn</code> : Boutons de bascule "
"(Mon Compte).<br>\n"
"                <code>.wt-retractable-section</code> : Conteneur pour les "
"champs E-mail/Mot de passe masqués.<br>\n"
"                <code>#billing_birth_date_field</code> : Champ Date de "
"naissance.<br>\n"
"                <code>.wt-toggle-stock</code> : Lien de bascule du stock "
"(Liste produits Admin).<br>\n"
"                <code>.wt-promo-badge</code> : Badge de pourcentage de "
"remise.<br>\n"
"                <code>.wt-promo-urgency-msg</code> : Message de fin de "
"promotion."

